namespace pdg { /**

\fn pdg::SpriteLayer::portToLayerRect

\brief adjust the rectangle to account for the effective camera

Adjusts for the effective camera view and port anchor to get layer coordinates for a rectangle on the screen.

Nonuniform scale or reflection returns enclosing bounds. For exact transformed corners, use the Quad conversion.

\param r Rect in port coordinates

\returns Rect in layer coordinates

**/ }